   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "A \nhemodialysis line was placed and CVVH was initiated to manage \nvolume overload post-op in the setting of acute on chronic renal \nfailure (baseline creat 3.0; peak 4.2) He developed \npost-operative afib and lopressor dose was uptitrated and \ncoumadin was started for prophylaxis.",
