  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-16:s1",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-05T14:46:00",
   "text": "Status post recent CABG and AVR with expected postoperative findings, including left lower lobe subsegmental atelectasis and a small left pleural effusion.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-16:chars=846-1001",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-17:s1",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-06T10:05:00",
   "text": "Slight improved appearance to the lung",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-17:chars=516-554",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-18:s1",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-06T16:09:00",
   "text": "No acute intracranial hemorrhage or mass effect.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-18:chars=1036-1084",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-18:s2",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-06T16:09:00",
   "text": "Correlate clinically to decide on the need for further workup or followup.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-18:chars=1085-1159",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-19:s1",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-06T21:07:00",
   "text": "1. Small left effusion is newly visible.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-19:chars=623-663",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-19:s2",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-06T21:07:00",
   "text": "2. Interval removal of Swan-Ganz catheter and mediastinal drain.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-19:chars=664-728",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-19:s3",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-06T21:07:00",
   "text": "3. Otherwise, I doubt significant interval change.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-19:chars=729-779",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-19:s4",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-06T21:07:00",
   "text": "4. Left lower lobe collapse and/or consolidation is similar to the prior film.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-19:chars=780-858",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-19:s5",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-06T21:07:00",
   "text": "No new area of opacity to suggest new superimposed pneumonia is detected.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-19:chars=859-932",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-20:s1",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-07T17:59:00",
   "text": "1. Interval placement of right IJ sheath and left IJ central line, both with tips over the mid SVC.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-20:chars=753-852",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-20:s2",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-07T17:59:00",
   "text": "No pneumothorax detected.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-20:chars=854-879",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-20:s3",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-07T17:59:00",
   "text": "2. Left lower lobe collapse and/or consolidation with possible small left effusion, similar to the prior study.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-20:chars=880-991",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-20:s4",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-07T17:59:00",
   "text": "3. Mild upper zone redistribution again noted, but doubt overt CHF.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-20:chars=992-1059",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-21:s1",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-08T16:58:00",
   "text": "1. Small right cerebellar hemispheric acute infarct.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-21:chars=1103-1155",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-21:s2",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-08T16:58:00",
   "text": "No hemorrhage, mass, or edema.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-21:chars=1157-1187",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-21:s3",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-08T16:58:00",
   "text": "2. Chronic findings including white matter small vessel ischemic changes and global involutional change.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-21:chars=1188-1292",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-22:s1",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-09T10:48:00",
   "text": "LUNGS ARE LOW IN VOLUME BUT GROSSLY CLEAR.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-22:chars=258-300",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-22:s2",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-09T10:48:00",
   "text": "PLEURAL EFFUSION IS SMALL IF ANY.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-22:chars=302-335",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-22:s3",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-09T10:48:00",
   "text": "NO PNEUMOTHORAX.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-22:chars=337-353",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-22:s4",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-09T10:48:00",
   "text": "MILD CARDIOMEGALY IS CHRONIC.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-22:chars=355-384",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-22:s5",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-09T10:48:00",
   "text": "LEFT JUGULAR LINE ENDS IN THE",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-22:chars=386-415",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-22:s6",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-09T10:48:00",
   "text": "LOW SVC.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=19480277-RR-22:chars=416-424",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:19480277-RR-22:s7",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2192-01-09T10:48:00",
